[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/dag_engine_lite/lib/dag_engine_lite.py: Implement DAG engine interface: exception records with __str__, NodeState/FailurePolicy enums, frozen data types (NodeDefinition, NodeResult, DAGRunReport), and abstract DAG/WaveScheduler/DAGRunner protocol stubs matching low/dag_engine_lite.pyi
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/dag_engine_lite/lib/dag_engine_lite_impl.py: Implement concrete DAG, WaveScheduler, and DAGRunner singletons: adjacency tracking with deferred dependency validation, deterministic Kahn topological sort (priority desc, node_id asc), DFS cycle detection, weighted critical path DP, state synchronization (READY/PENDING promotion, removal purge), failure policies (FAIL_FAST cancel, SKIP_DOWNSTREAM/CONTINUE_ON_ERROR skip blocked dependents), retry-aware sequential wave execution and DAGRunReport aggregation
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/dag_engine_lite/tests/dag_engine_lite_impl_test.py: Authored 42 contract-derived unit tests for DAG, WaveScheduler, and DAGRunner: graph mutation/query/copy semantics, deferred dependency validation, cycle detection, deterministic topological ordering (priority desc, node_id asc), critical-path computation with default and estimated weights, wave readiness/promotion, all failure policies (FAIL_FAST/CONTINUE_ON_ERROR/SKIP_DOWNSTREAM), is_finished terminal and empty-DAG behavior, dynamic scheduler state synchronization, and runner sequential execution, retries, policy application, report aggregation, and pre-execution validation errors. All singletons resolved through isolated LifecycleRegistry phase scopes; static checks pass.
